  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community- led Flood Anticipatory Action to safeguard lives and livelihoods in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aligns with objectives two and three of the CPF, where the project will build the capacity of the community and local governance structures to respond to and/or anticipate for the effects of the recent prolonged drought, and to mitigate the impact of upcoming El Nino rains (October- December 2023) respectively, while saving lives and livelihoods to mitigate the scale and impact of anticipated humanitarian crisis</narrative>
  </description>
